@startuml XHION-CORE-AWS-SIMPLE

title Diagrama de Despliegue - XHION CORE (AWS Serverless)\nReact + Vite + NestJS + Prisma + PostgreSQL

skinparam {
  backgroundColor #FFFFFF
  shadowing false
  defaultFontName Arial
  defaultFontSize 11
  
  node {
    BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
    BorderColor #333333
    BorderThickness 2
    FontSize 12
    FontStyle bold
  }
  
  component {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #666666
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontSize 10
  }
  
  database {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #666666
    BorderThickness 1.5
  }
}

' ============================================================================
' CLIENTE
' ============================================================================

node "Navegador Web\n(Chrome/Edge/Safari)" as Browser {
  component "React App\n(TypeScript + Vite)" as ReactApp
}

' ============================================================================
' CDN
' ============================================================================

node "AWS CloudFront\n(CDN Global)" as CloudFront {
  component "Distribución\nHTTPS/SSL" as CDN
}

' ============================================================================
' FRONTEND STORAGE
' ============================================================================

node "AWS S3\n(Static Hosting)" as S3Frontend {
  component "Build Output\nHTML/CSS/JS" as StaticFiles
}

' ============================================================================
' API GATEWAY
' ============================================================================

node "AWS API Gateway" as APIGateway {
  component "REST API\nRoutes + Auth" as RestAPI
  component "WebSocket API\nReal-time" as WebSocketAPI
}

' ============================================================================
' LAMBDA FUNCTIONS
' ============================================================================

node "AWS Lambda Functions" as Lambda {
  component "Backend API\nNestJS + Prisma\n(Node.js 20)" as NestJSApp
  component "WebSocket Handler\nonConnect/onDisconnect" as WSHandler
}

' ============================================================================
' DATABASES
' ============================================================================

node "AWS RDS Aurora Serverless" as RDS {
  database "PostgreSQL 15\nAuto-scaling\n0.5-16 ACU" as PostgreSQL
}

node "AWS DynamoDB" as DynamoDB {
  database "WebSocket\nConnections" as WSConnections
}

' ============================================================================
' FILE STORAGE
' ============================================================================

node "AWS S3\n(File Storage)" as S3Files {
  component "Uploads\nAvatars/Documents" as Uploads
}

' ============================================================================
' RELACIONES
' ============================================================================

Browser --> CloudFront : HTTPS
CloudFront --> S3Frontend : Origin Request
Browser --> APIGateway : API Requests\n(HTTPS)

APIGateway --> NestJSApp : Invoke Lambda
APIGateway --> WSHandler : WebSocket Events

NestJSApp --> PostgreSQL : Prisma ORM\n(CRUD Operations)
WSHandler --> WSConnections : Store Connections
NestJSApp --> Uploads : Upload/Download

' ============================================================================
' NOTAS
' ============================================================================

note right of CloudFront
  **CDN Global**
  - 200+ Edge Locations
  - Cache automático
  - SSL/TLS incluido
end note

note right of Lambda
  **Serverless Backend**
  - Auto-scaling
  - Pay per invocation
  - 0 mantenimiento
end note

note right of RDS
  **Auto-scaling DB**
  - Se pausa cuando inactivo
  - Ahorro del 70%
  - Backup automático
end note

note bottom
  **Stack Tecnológico:**
  Frontend: React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS + Zustand
  Backend: NestJS + TypeScript + Prisma ORM + Passport.js (JWT)
  Database: PostgreSQL 15 (Aurora Serverless)
  Real-time: WebSocket API + DynamoDB
  
  **Escalabilidad:** Automática e infinita
end note

@enduml
